    <detaileddescription>
<para>Result of comparing two snapshots for the same table.</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_snapshot_diff_1ac79febea935400dd4b10654eb1b90cfe" kindref="member">added</ref></computeroutput> — rows present in <computeroutput>handle_b</computeroutput> but absent in <computeroutput>handle_a</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_snapshot_diff_1aed746a7660efe887cb08f13beef16013" kindref="member">removed</ref></computeroutput> — rows present in <computeroutput>handle_a</computeroutput> but absent in <computeroutput>handle_b</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1temporal_1_1_snapshot_diff_1a82d60c9fdbf01d46048ede05d35dd298" kindref="member">modified</ref></computeroutput> — rows present in both snapshots whose <computeroutput>data</computeroutput> has changed (contains the <computeroutput>handle_b</computeroutput> version). </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
